cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this table, please cite it as below, and credit the holder and source named in each row."
type: dataset
title: "Named constants: best known bounds, who holds them, and checkers"
abstract: "A living table of named mathematical constants: for each bound, the best value known, who holds it and where it is published, Quantavane's own certified bound where there is one, and a program that checks it. Includes the 240 bounds of Terence Tao's table of optimization constants with their holders read from each constant's page."
authors:
  - family-names: Canli
    given-names: Arhan
    affiliation: Quantavane
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/arhancanli/quantavane-constants"
keywords:
  - mathematical constants
  - best known bounds
  - certificates
  - checkers
